# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/

# Editors
.idea/
.vscode/

# Credentials — never commit. SimulationsVM_key.pem is the Azure VM key and
# belongs outside the repository altogether.
*.pem
*.key

# Simulation output and analysis products. Results live under TISSUE_RESULTS_DIR
# (D:\kasirer\model_results by default), not in the tree; these patterns catch the
# strays that land here. The tables are reproducible from the runs and are
# submitted to the journal separately.
#
# *.json and *.svg joined the list for the same reason the others are here: the
# scoring scripts write their caches (psigma_scores_*.json) relative to the
# working directory, and the figures are saved as png AND svg, so a run from
# the checkout leaves both in the tree. No json or svg has ever been tracked
# here; if one ever needs to be, add it with ``git add -f``.
*.hf5
*.npy
*.npz
*.jsonl
*.json
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.ods
*.log
*.out
*.err
*.png
*.svg
*.gif
results/

# Local run scaffolding
*.bat
*.sh
environment.yml
*.bak

# The vendored tyssue is its own clone of github.com/damcb/tyssue, carrying our
# upstream patches on its own branch. It must not be absorbed into this repo as
# a gitlink or a copy — clone it alongside and point PYTHONPATH at tyssue/src.
tyssue/
